# Next.js / React Rules
- Keep render clean: compute conditions BEFORE return.
- Avoid complex expressions inside JSX.
- Internal event handlers must be named handleX (handleClick, handleSubmit).
- Props for events must be named onX (onClick, onSubmit).
- Prefer composition over excessive prop customization.
- Extract components only when repetition or isolation truly improves reuse.
